    "Contact Us, Submit Bug Report, Submit Blog, Submit an App, Submit a Podcast, Report a Comment, and Change Password/Email now have a Next/Submit button at the bottom of every step, matching setup's wizard — not just the top-right corner. A beta tester's own experience prompted this: swiping to the end of a list of choices, as VoiceOver naturally does, used to land on nothing actionable. When a step isn't ready to continue, a short note now explains exactly what's still needed — a specific field, a minimum length, an unchecked box — instead of a silently disabled button." : {
