    "Every step's title and explanation, every button, and the tour's own name showed up in English throughout the entire tour no matter what language the app was set to — the same bug already fixed elsewhere in the app, and in this case, all 28 steps already had full translations sitting unused. Fixed, so all of it displays correctly now." : {
