    "The same double-announcement fixed above in Home Startup Behavior — VoiceOver saying a setting's value twice in a row on a plain swipe — was actually present in every picker across Settings that supports swipe up/down to change its value: Web Links, Notification Sound, Card Density, Keep Cache For, and all eight pickers in Podcasts (Speed, Skip Back, Skip Forward, Equaliser, Sleep Timer, Resume Rewind, Auto-Download, Auto-Delete). All fixed the same way. Reported directly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
